#: applications/luci-app-crowdsec-firewall-bouncer/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/crowdsec-firewall-bouncer/form.js:11
msgid ""
"Gain <a href=\"http://www.crowdsec.net\">crowd-sourced</a> protection "
